}}'''Present''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 4th tier of the [[Christmas Event 2023]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh.  The blade is wrapped with a red ribbon with a green ribbon on top of it. The guard is grey and the handle is black, with red ribbons surrounding it.
